    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お疲れ様！\r\n会場、すごい盛り上がってたぞ！",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい。ありがとうございますっ\r\nでも……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900104/1009001040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bgm": "008",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "果穂、どうかしたのか？",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あ、すみません！　……あの、さっき、小さい女の子の\r\nお客さんがあたしに話しかけてくれたんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900104/1009001040080"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "今日、あたしに会えることを\r\nとっても楽しみにしてたって",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900104/1009001040090"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "その子はヒーローショーじゃなくて、\r\nあたしのことを観に来たって言ってくれたんですっ",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900104/1009001040100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお、すごいじゃないか！",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい！\r\nあたしもスゴくうれしいんですけど、よくわからなくて……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900104/1009001040110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "何がだ？",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたしずっと、ヒーローショーってカッコいいヒーローを\r\n見るところだって思ってたんです",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900104/1009001040120"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "でも、ヒーローじゃなくてあたしを観に来た、\r\nってどういうことなんでしょう？",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900104/1009001040130"
  },
  {
    "select": "果穂のことが\r\n好きだからだ",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "果穂に憧れているん\r\nじゃないかな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "select": "俺も果穂から目が\r\n離せなかったからな",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "でもヒーローショーなのに、\r\nヒーローじゃなくてよかったんでしょうか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900104/1009001040140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いいと思うぞ。例えば……果穂はヒーローが好きで、\r\nヒーローショーを見に行ってたんだろう",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい！　カッコいいヒーローを見ると\r\n元気がもらえますからっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900104/1009001040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "果穂に話しかけてくれた女の子も、\r\nきっと果穂と一緒なんだよ",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その子はアイドルの果穂が好きで\r\n見に来てくれたんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "そうなんですね！　……あたし、自分がそんな風に\r\n思われてるなんて、考えてもいませんでした！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900104/1009001040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "果穂はもう、ヒーローみたいな……\r\n誰かにとっての、憧れの存在になってるんだよ",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "そっか……えへへ！\r\nじゃあ、もっともっと頑張らないとですね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900104/1009001040170"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたしの好きなヒーローはいっつもカッコいいんです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900104/1009001040180"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "だからあたしもアイドルとして、\r\nもっと憧れてもらえるようにならなくちゃっ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900104/1009001040190"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたしに憧れ……\r\nヒーローよりも、ですか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900104/1009001040200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。小学生の果穂が、ステージの上でアイドルを\r\nしているのは、その小さな女の子にとっての憧れなんだよ",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたしがヒーローに憧れるみたいに、ですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900104/1009001040210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん。その女の子はアイドル「小宮果穂」みたいに\r\nなりたいのかもな",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "アイドル、小宮果穂……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900104/1009001040220"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさんっ。あたし、\r\nもっと憧れられるようなアイドルになりたいです！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900104/1009001040230"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "それで、あたしがヒーローに元気をもらったみたいに、\r\nもっといろんな人に元気をあげられたらいいなって！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900104/1009001040240"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "なので、いろんな人の憧れになれるように、\r\nこれからもっと頑張りますっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900104/1009001040250"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんは、いつもちゃんと見てくれてますっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900104/1009001040260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや。今日はそうじゃなくて、\r\n果穂を見ていたら笑顔が止まらなかったんだ",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "果穂がアイドルとして……お客さんから笑顔をもらって\r\nキラキラ輝いていた……だから目も離せなかったんだよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "アイドルとしての輝きですか……\r\nなんだか、強そうですっ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900104/1009001040270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "果穂の輝きと強さは\r\nみんなを笑顔にする力があるんだ",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへ！　それってなんだか、ヒーローの力みたいですっ！\r\n……アイドルの強さも、みんなを笑顔にできるんですね",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900104/1009001040280"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたし、みんなをもっと笑顔にできる、\r\n強いアイドルになりたいです！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
